  "factor_name": "Drawdown Recovery with Improving Path",
  "version": "1.0",
  "calculation": {
    "expression": "lag1(abs(drawdown(close,60)) * ((ROC(close,10)-lag10(ROC(close,30))) / vol20) * max(0, 1 - abs(ROC(close,10))/sum(abs(daily_return),10)) / vol20)",
    "description": "Ranks assets with deep 60-day drawdowns and an improving 10-day path relative to the preceding 30-day return, penalizing inefficient recent movement and scaling by realized volatility. The one-day lag prevents look-ahead."
